  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.1 includes significant improvements to error handling, particularly for API responses. We've added specific handling for HTTP 402 (Payment Required) status codes, which now clearly indicates when operations fail due to insufficient credits. This update enhances the developer experience by providing more descriptive error messages and better exception handling, especially in the create operation endpoint.",
